:: StoryInterface
<div id="vidhi-ui">
	<div id="vh-header" data-passage="UI_Header"></div>
	<div id="vh-side" data-passage="UI_Sidebar"></div>
	<div id="vh-main"><div id="passages"></div></div>
	<div id="vh-stats" data-passage="UI_Stats"></div>
</div>


:: StoryInit
<<set $pov to "arjun">>
<<set $day to 1>>
<<set $time to { arjun: 392, kavya: 330 }>>
<<set $loc to { arjun: "katraj_pg_room", kavya: "hostel_room_304" }>>
<<set $povUnlocked to { arjun: true, kavya: false }>>
<<set $flags to {}>>
<<set $objectives to {}>>
<<set $sideDiscovered to []>>
<<set $firedEvents to []>>
<<set $eventQueue to []>>
<<set $doneActions to {}>>
<<set $inventory to []>>
<<set $intimateSeen to []>>
<<set $swapCount to 0>>
<<set $swapActive to false>>
<<set $barrierIntegrity to 100>>
<<set $_phonePending to null>>
<<set $stats to {
	money_arjun: 500, money_kavya: 800,
	a_coding: 85, a_med: 5, a_femComfort: 0, a_sexM: 15, a_sexF: 0, a_energy: 60,
	k_coding: 70, k_med: 45, k_mascComfort: 0, k_sexF: 10, k_sexM: 0, k_energy: 55,
	rel_arjun_meera: 90, rel_arjun_kavya: 30, rel_arjun_rohit: 30, rel_arjun_raju: 0, rel_arjun_ananya: 0,
	rel_kavya_meera: 85, rel_kavya_arjun: 30, rel_kavya_priya: 5, rel_kavya_sneha: 3,
	rel_kavya_divya: 0, rel_kavya_messdidi: 0,
	trust_meera: 0, rel_triad: 0, karma: 0,
	susp_priya: 0, susp_colonel: 0, susp_rohit: 0, susp_warden: 0
}>>
<<set $mood to { arjun: "melancholy", kavya: "guarded" }>>
<<set $body to { arjun: "arjun", kavya: "kavya" }>>
<<set $profileImg to { arjun: "", kavya: "" }>>
<<set $arjunOutfit to "">>
<<set $arjunToldRohit to "">>
<<set $kavyaJournal to false>>
<<run setup.refreshObjectives()>>


:: Start [nobr]
<div class="title-screen">
<div class="th">शरीर बदल</div>
<div class="te">VIDHI · The Body Swap Chronicles</div>
<p class="lede">Pune, Maharashtra. Monsoon fading, humidity clinging like a jealous ex. Two colleges on opposite sides of the city. Two people who have never met   a boy who codes elegant Python and cannot reach the girl he loves, and a girl who dissects cadavers she despises and writes brilliant code no one knows is hers.</p>
<p class="lede">Between them: a retired Colonel, a locked hostel, a six-hundred-year-old palm-leaf manuscript, and a plan that should not be possible.</p>
<div class="start-btn">[[Continue|ContentWarning]]</div>
</div>


:: ContentWarning [nobr]
<div class="cw-box">
<h2>Before you begin</h2>
<p><b>VIDHI is an adult narrative game (18+).</b> It contains explicit sexual content, nudity, detailed body description, and themes of bodily autonomy, coercion and control, gender transformation, family estrangement, and surveillance. All sexual content is between adult characters (21+).</p>
<p>Nothing is hidden behind a per-scene toggle   the intimate and sexual scenes are part of the story and will appear in context as you explore. If that is not what you want, close the tab now.</p>
<p>This is fiction. The supernatural body-swap premise is a plot device, not a statement about real people or identities.</p>
</div>
<div class="choices">
	<<link "I understand, and I am 18 or older   begin Day 1">>
		<<goto "Intro">>
	<</link>>
</div>


:: Intro
<<img "arjun_reference.png" "Arjun Deshmukh">>
<<img "kavya_reference.png" "Kavya Iyer">>

Some stories start with a choice. This one starts with a boy who has run out of them.

His name is <b>Arjun Deshmukh</b>. Twenty-one, third-year Computer Science at VIT, a black Pulsar, a PG room in Katraj he shares with a snoring mechanical-engineering disaster named Rohit. Six months ago a retired Army colonel walked into a girls' hostel and confiscated his own daughter's phone, her freedom, and every thread connecting her to Arjun. Her name is Meera. Arjun has been a ghost ever since.

<span class="scene-break"></span>

Twenty minutes across the city, in Room 304 of the B.J. Medical girls' hostel, <b>Kavya Iyer</b> wakes at 5:30 every morning whether she wants to or not. She is a third-year MBBS student who cannot stand the smell of formalin and a self-taught programmer with a GitHub under a name nobody can trace. Her roommate Meera is the one person in the building who understands what it means to be enrolled in a life you did not choose.

<span class="scene-break"></span>

Neither of them knows the other exists yet. Your story begins with the boy   his alarm has not gone off, but Rohit's snoring has.

<div class="continue-nav">[[Wake up|arjun_wake]]</div>


:: Hub
<<if $eventQueue.length gt 0>>\
<<set _ev to $eventQueue.shift()>><<goto _ev>>\
<<else>>\
<<set _L to setup.here()>>\
<<if not setup.locAvailable(_L)>>\
<div class="loc-card"><h2 class="loc-name"><<= _L.name>></h2>\
<p class="loc-time"><<= setup.clockStr()>> · <<= setup.dayName()>></p>\
<p class="loc-desc">It's <<= setup.clockStr()>>. This place is shuttered right now   nothing to do here until it opens.</p></div>
<h3>Go</h3>
<div class="action-list">\
<<for _x range _L.exits>><<capture _x>>\
<<set _xl to setup.exitLock(_x)>>\
<<if _xl is "">><<link `_x.label`>><<if setup.travel(_x.to, _x.travelTime ? _x.travelTime : 2, _x.method) neq "block">><<goto "Hub">><</if>><</link>>\
<<elseif _xl isnot null>><span class="exit-locked"><<= _x.label>> <span class="exit-lock-note">🔒 <<= _xl>></span></span>\
<</if>>\
<</capture>><</for>>\
</div>
<<else>>\
<div class="loc-card">\
<<= setup.img(_L.image, _L.name)>>\
<h2 class="loc-name"><<= _L.name>></h2>\
<p class="loc-time"><<= setup.clockStr()>> · <<= setup.dayName()>> · <<= setup.dayPhase()>></p>\
<p class="loc-desc"><<= _L.description>></p>\
</div>
<<if _L.npcs && _L.npcs.length gt 0>>\
<h3>Here right now</h3>
<div class="npc-row">\
<<for _n range _L.npcs>><span class="npc-chip"><<= setup.npcNames[_n] ? setup.npcNames[_n] : _n>></span><</for>>\
</div>
<</if>>\
<h3>Look around · do</h3>
<p class="act-legend"><span class="lg main">main story</span> <span class="lg side">side quest</span></p>
<div class="action-list">\
<<for _o range _L.objects>><<capture _o>>\
<<if setup.objVisible(_o) && setup.objInWindow(_o)>>\
<span @class="(_o.quest ? ('act act-' + _o.quest) : 'act') + (setup.actionDone(_o) ? ' done' : '')"><<link `_o.action`>><<if setup.useObject(_o) neq "block">><<goto setup.objTarget(_o)>><</if>><</link>></span>\
<</if>>\
<</capture>><</for>>\
</div>
<<if setup.canRestHere()>>\
<div class="wait-row">\
<<link "⏳ Wait here   30 min">><<run setup.passTime(30)>><<goto "Hub">><</link>>\
<<link "😴 Rest / nap   1 hour">><<run setup.passTime(60)>><<goto "Hub">><</link>>\
</div>
<</if>>\
<h3>Go</h3>
<div class="action-list">\
<<for _x range _L.exits>><<capture _x>>\
<<set _xl to setup.exitLock(_x)>>\
<<if _xl is "">><<link `_x.label`>><<if setup.travel(_x.to, _x.travelTime ? _x.travelTime : 2, _x.method) neq "block">><<goto "Hub">><</if>><</link>>\
<<elseif _xl isnot null>><span class="exit-locked"><<= _x.label>> <span class="exit-lock-note">🔒 <<= _xl>></span></span>\
<</if>>\
<</capture>><</for>>\
<<if _L.travelDestinations>><<for _d range _L.travelDestinations>><<capture _d>>\
<<set _dl to setup.exitLock(_d)>>\
<<if _dl is "">><<link `_d.label`>><<if setup.travel(_d.to, _d.travelTime ? _d.travelTime : 10, _d.method) neq "block">><<goto "Hub">><</if>><</link>>\
<<elseif _dl isnot null>><span class="exit-locked"><<= _d.label>> <span class="exit-lock-note">🔒 <<= _dl>></span></span>\
<</if>>\
<</capture>><</for>><</if>>\
</div>
<</if>>\
<</if>>


:: UI_Header
<div class="logo">विधि<span class="en">VIDHI</span></div>\
<div class="clock"><<= setup.clockStr()>></div>\
<span class="hist-nav">\
<<link "‹">><<run Engine.backward()>><</link>>\
<<link "›">><<run Engine.forward()>><</link>>\
</span>\
<div class="pov-toggle">\
<<if $pov is "arjun">><span class="pov-cur arjun">Arjun</span>\
<<elseif $povUnlocked.arjun>><<link "Arjun" "Hub">><<run setup.pickPOV("arjun")>><</link>>\
<<else>><span class="pov-lock">Arjun</span><</if>>\
<<if $pov is "kavya">><span class="pov-cur kavya">Kavya</span>\
<<elseif $povUnlocked.kavya>><<link "Kavya" "Hub">><<run setup.pickPOV("kavya")>><</link>>\
<<else>><span class="pov-lock">Kavya</span><</if>>\
</div>\
<span class="hdr-phones">\
<<if $pov is "arjun">><<link "📱 Phone">><<run setup.openPhone("arjun")>><</link>>\
<<else>><<link "📱 Samsung">><<run setup.openPhone("samsung")>><</link>>\
<<if setup.hasItem("redmi_phone")>><<link "🔒 Redmi">><<run setup.openPhone("redmi")>><</link>><</if>>\
<</if>>\
<<link "？ Help">><<run setup.openHelp()>><</link>>\
</span>


:: UI_Sidebar
<div class="pov-card">\
<div class="pov-face-wrap"><span class="pov-initial"><<= $pov is "arjun" ? "अ" : "क">></span><img class="pov-face" @src="setup.profileImgSrc()" alt="" onerror="this.remove()"></div>\
<div class="pov-meta"><div class="pov-name"><<= $pov is "arjun" ? "Arjun Deshmukh" : "Kavya Iyer">></div><div class="pov-body"><<= setup.bodyLine()>> · Day <<= $day>></div></div>\
</div>\
<<if $pov is "arjun">><h3>Objectives   Arjun</h3><<else>><h3>Objectives   Kavya</h3><</if>>\
<<set _mainCount to 0>>\
<<for _o range setup.objectives[$pov].main>><<if _o.day is $day>><<set _mainCount to _mainCount + 1>><</if>><</for>>\
<<if _mainCount gt 0>>\
<div class="quest-legend"><span class="lg main">Main story</span><span class="lg side">Side quest</span></div>\
<h4 class="obj-sub">Main story</h4>\
<ul class="obj-list">\
<<for _o range setup.objectives[$pov].main>><<if _o.day is $day>><<= setup.objLine(_o, false)>><</if>><</for>>\
</ul>\
<<else>>\
<p class="obj-empty">Day <<= $day>> objectives aren't in this build yet.</p>\
<</if>>\
<<set _sideOpen to 0>><<set _sideDone to 0>>\
<<for _o range setup.objectives[$pov].side>>\
<<if _o.day is $day and $sideDiscovered.includes(_o.id)>>\
<<if setup.objState(_o) is "complete">><<set _sideDone to _sideDone + 1>><<else>><<set _sideOpen to _sideOpen + 1>><</if>>\
<</if>>\
<</for>>\
<<if _sideOpen gt 0>>\
<h4 class="obj-sub">Side quests</h4>\
<ul class="obj-list">\
<<for _o range setup.objectives[$pov].side>>\
<<if _o.day is $day and $sideDiscovered.includes(_o.id) and setup.objState(_o) neq "complete">><<= setup.objLine(_o, true)>><</if>>\
<</for>>\
</ul>\
<</if>>\
<<if _sideDone gt 0>><p class="side-done">✓ <<= _sideDone>> side quest<<if _sideDone gt 1>>s<</if>> done</p>\
<</if>>\
<h3>Inventory</h3>\
<<if $inventory.length gt 0>><<for _i range $inventory>><span class="inv-chip"><<= setup.itemNames[_i] ? setup.itemNames[_i] : _i>></span><</for>><<else>><span class="obj-empty">Empty.</span><</if>>\
<h3>Wallet</h3>\
<span class="inv-chip">₹<<= setup.money()>></span>\
<img class="mandala" src="images/mandala.svg" alt="">


:: UI_Stats
<div class="who-card">\
<<if $pov is "arjun">><div class="dot">अ</div><div><div class="nm">Arjun Deshmukh</div><div class="sub"><<= setup.clockStr()>> · <<= $mood.arjun>></div></div>\
<<else>><div class="dot">क</div><div><div class="nm">Kavya Iyer</div><div class="sub"><<= setup.clockStr()>> · <<= $mood.kavya>></div></div><</if>>\
</div>
<h3>Skills</h3>
<<if $pov is "arjun">>\
<<= setup.statBar("Coding", $stats.a_coding, "green")>><<= setup.statBar("Medical", $stats.a_med, "saffron")>><<= setup.statBar("Feminine comfort", $stats.a_femComfort, "purple")>><<= setup.statBar("Energy", $stats.a_energy, "blue")>>\
<<else>>\
<<= setup.statBar("Coding", $stats.k_coding, "green")>><<= setup.statBar("Medical", $stats.k_med, "saffron")>><<= setup.statBar("Masculine comfort", $stats.k_mascComfort, "blue")>><<= setup.statBar("Energy", $stats.k_energy, "purple")>>\
<</if>>
<h3>Relationships</h3>
<<if $pov is "arjun">>\
<<= setup.statBar("Meera", $stats.rel_arjun_meera, "pink")>><<= setup.statBar("Rohit", $stats.rel_arjun_rohit, "gold")>>\
<<else>>\
<<= setup.statBar("Meera", $stats.rel_kavya_meera, "pink")>><<= setup.statBar("Priya", $stats.rel_kavya_priya, "gold")>><<= setup.statBar("Trust · Meera", $stats.trust_meera, "gold")>>\
<</if>>
<div class="swap-box"><div class="n"><<= $swapCount>></div><div class="cl">Swaps · barrier <<= $barrierIntegrity>>%</div></div>
<h3>Suspicion</h3>
<<= setup.susRow("Priya", $stats.susp_priya)>><<= setup.susRow("Colonel", $stats.susp_colonel)>><<= setup.susRow("Rohit", $stats.susp_rohit)>><<= setup.susRow("Warden", $stats.susp_warden)>>
<h3>Game</h3>
<div class="sys-btns">\
<<link "💾 Save / Load">><<run UI.saves()>><</link>>\
<<link "⟲ Restart">><<run UI.restart()>><</link>>\
</div>
